<br />Important Note on &lt;Nullable&gt;enable&lt;/Nullable&gt;
<br />Since you enabled Nullable in the .csproj, your ModEntry.cs will produce a warning because Config is not initialized in the constructor. To fix this warning, update the Config declaration in your ModEntry.cs like this:
